        <details key="documentation" value="A Boolean that indicates whether the data type is a binary large object (BLOB) and has very long data.True indicates that the data type is a BLOB that contains very long data; the definition of very long data is server-specific.False indicates that the data type is a BLOB that does not contain very long data or that is not a BLOB.This column value determines the setting of the DBCOLUMNFLAGS_ISLONG flag that is returned by GetColumnInfo in IColumnsInfo and the setting of the DBCOLUMNFLAGS_ISLONG flag that is returned by GetParameterInfo in ICommandWithParameters."/>
